      "text": "Lehi1 sees heavens open, 1 Ne. 1:8. Nephi1 sees heavens open, 1 Ne. 11:14 (12:6). the Lord hath opened mine ear, 2 Ne. 7:5 (Isa. 50:5). whoso knocketh, to him will the Lord open, 2 Ne. 9:42 (3 Ne. 14:7–8; 27:29; Matt. 7:7–8). open your ears that ye may hear, Mosiah 2:9. he was afflicted, yet he opened not his mouth, Mosiah 14:7 (15:6; Isa. 53:7). priests fast and pray that the Lord might open mouth of Alma2 and open eyes of people to see goodness and glory of God, Mosiah 27:22.",
