    {
      "text": "knock and it shall be opened, D&C 4:7 (6:5; 11:5; 12:5; 14:5; 88:63). open thy mouth at all times, declaring gospel, D&C 28:16. graves to be opened, D&C 29:26 (88:97; 133:56). the Lord wills that disciples and men should open hearts, D&C 58:52. the Lord not pleased with elders who open not their mouths, D&C 60:2. by power of the Spirit our eyes were opened, D&C 76:12. sixth and seventh seals to be opened, D&C 77:13. those who believe shall open eyes of blind in the Lord’s name, D&C 84:69. heavens were opened, and the Holy Ghost descended upon Christ, D&C 93:15. effectual door shall be opened, D&C 100:3 (118:3). pray that ears of wicked may be opened, D&C 101:92. power of Melchizedek Priesthood is to have heavens opened unto them, D&C 107:19. heavens were opened unto us, D&C 110:11 (137:1). I saw the dead and the books were opened, D&C 128:6–7. eyes of understanding were opened, D&C 138:11, 29.",
